Plan summary: {{plan.summary}}
Risk: {{risk.level}} - {{risk.blastRadius}}
Open questions: {{spec.openQuestions|titles}}
Unknowns: {{risk.unknowns|titles}}
Engineer's note: {{note}}

Ticket {{ticket.key}}: {{ticket.summary}}

{{ticket.description}}

