workflow.prompt:
The lint command failed on the files this change touches. Turn the failures into pre-flight blockers for the plan.

Use ONLY the failures below and the ticket. Never invent an error, a file or a cause you cannot see in the output. If a failure is unrelated to this change, say so in the blocker's why.

Return blockers, each with a title and why it must be fixed or accepted before rollout, and a one-sentence summary.

Lint summary: {{checks.summary}}
Failures:
{{checks.failures|json}}

