Files: {{files.files[].file}}

The DevOps engineer read the plan below and asked for a safer, more staged version. Rewrite it so the change lands in smaller reversible stages, with an explicit verification and a rollback point after each stage.

Use ONLY the ticket, the files and the risk assessment. Never invent commands, environments or approvals that are not in that material. Keep the same goal: do not widen the scope.

Return the same structure as before: rollout, verification, rollback, rollbackTrigger, followUps, summary.

